# Unreal Engine build artifacts
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Saved/
*.sln
*.suo
*.user

# Python artifacts
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

# MCP server runtime files
mcp/ue_remote_execution_bridge/usage.log
mcp/ue_remote_execution_bridge/.sessions/

# IDE and editor directories
.vs/
.idea/

# Local-only docs - synced scaffolds (.claude/rules/) and internal docs, never committed (see docs/SETUP.md)
# Root-anchored: nested distributable docs (e.g. mcp/.../docs/) stay tracked.
/.claude/
/docs/
